  "checks": {
    "identity-and-scale": "All eight exported poses and all eight poses in the actual controlled-clock camp renderer inspected. Same bald Elder, white beard, embroidered olive coat, belt, pouches and boots. Source-bound740px standing-equivalent seated placement preserves his scale; breathing and head motion do not resize the body.",
    "station-and-foot-contact": "Both boots, stool and seated pelvis retain their fixed ground baseline throughout0-7 and7-to0. The camp root does not move. This is a seated appearance review, not material sole/cane contact calibration during travel.",
    "hand-and-tool-contact": "Right hand retains the same bread piece as it rises0-3 to the mouth/beard, rests near the mouth4 and lowers5-7. Left palm and fingers keep the bowl supported in his lap. Mouth occlusion and hand ownership checked across all eight native and live poses; this is a cosmetic eating gesture.",
    "prop-continuity": "Same bread piece, wooden bowl and stool in every pose. The bread piece remains depicted rather than vanishing or being consumed. This fixed-view ambient gesture does not spend food, simulate a measured bite or certify hidden finger anatomy.",
    "last-to-first-transition": "Frame7 lowers the bread to the same chest position as0, with continuous right-hand grip and left-hand bowl support. All eight poses and0/7 comparison reviewed. Live playback finishes once, holds7, then makes a distinct preloaded activity handoff. No seamless transition to a different activity is implied."
